{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星林允、宋軼、陳凱琳（Grace）、歌手楊千嬅、Tyson Yoshi等前晚（8日）於廣州南沙出席風尚盛典活動，眾女星悉心打扮，林允以濕髮造型結合不規則剪裁的裸粉色緞面流光裙上陣，大晒美腿，獲讚是「真人版濕髮人魚公主」。</p><p>她透露劇集《歸</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.383766+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T16:01:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"bc46b6b0bff3c6987ed9864577064577ee74ba30607e7791545e026840fc5163","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}